{"The method `include_website_name` is missing the required `?` suffix. Active Model Serializers uses `include_#{attribute}?` convention to conditionally include attributes. Without the `?`, this method won't be called as a conditional, and `website_name` will always be serialized (potentially as `null` when no website is set) instead of being omitted when `website` is not present.": 0.7376152276992798, "The `website_name` attribute bypasses trust level protection since it's not in the `untrusted_attributes` list, while the `website` attribute is protected. This means the user's website domain can be exposed even when `website` itself is intentionally hidden for privacy reasons.": 0.8690571188926697, "The `website_name` method repeatedly performs the same expensive operations: `URI(website.to_s)` is parsed four times, `website_host.split('.')` is called three times, and `discourse_host.split('.')` is called three times. These values could be computed once and stored in local variables.": 0.3743789494037628}